rter.' TradingKey week ahead (22 Nov 2026): Best Buy among Tuesday's reports.", "DE": "StockTitan earnings calendar (20 Nov 2026): 'Deere, the tractor maker, holds its call on Wednesday', before the open, call 10:00 a.m. ET. TradingKey week ahead (22 Nov 2026): 'Deere is scheduled to hold its fourth-quarter earnings conference call that day' (Wednesday 25 Nov)."}}